        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e6be31a-a6f6-4b61-b7fa-6e37d4b69a2c).Image",
        "Description": "It appears that we have made a grave mistake. Chit was neither of the targets in Hokkaido. We have gathered evidence on the former client who mislead us. We have also learnt that this former client may have been in cahoots with Chit. Therefore, we have to take care of our former client, Will Irwin, and his chief security manager, Alec Shaw, before they can plan their next move with Chit. \r\rGo get it, 47. The Chit awaits",
